@ 29.1.1.1.8 - Proto-Athabaskan to Dena’ina
# citation: Whimemsz, from Krauss, Michael and Victor Golla (1981), “Northern Athapaskan Languages”. Handbook of North American Indians, Vol. 6 (Subarctic), 67 – 85
	{TŠ,TŠʷ} → TŠ (→ TS in Upper Inlet dialect)
	e a u {ə,ʊ} → a u i ə
	{ʃ(ʷ),x {z,ʒ(ʷ),ɣ} → s j
	Vˀ → V[-glottalized]